# fixtures/hex/decode-only/journal-cursor/log.1.hex: store J, decode-only. `JournalCursor` (kind 21) is reserved:
# format-v1 writers never append it ([F05 §7], §9.21), but a v1 reader decodes it. A lazy group holds one record
# with an upsert (a `usn` cursor of volume C, the 41-byte JOURNALCUR row of [F11 §12.9]) and a delete (by
# vol_key) of another volume's cursor.

